":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{B}{B}","name":"Sign in Blood","oracle_id":"c6207f6a-a624-4754-88f5-dbe700c841ff","oracle_text":"Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2024-09-27","toughness":null,"type_line":"Sorcery"},{"cmc":0.0,"color_identity":["B"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Swamp","oracle_id":"56719f6a-1a6c-4c0a-8d21-18f7d7350b68","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {B}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["B"],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Basic Land — Swamp"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{2}{W}{W}","name":"Test of Endurance","oracle_id":"ffdad8fb-69ee-40d3-b2eb-b0aee0a5becc","oracle_text":"At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 50 or more life, you win the game.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2023-01-13","toughness":null,"type_line":"Enchantment"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Angel's Grace doesn't prevent damage. It only changes the result of damage dealt to you. For example, a 5/5 creature with lifelink that deals damage to you will still cause its controller to gain 5 life, even if that damage reduces your life total from 3 to 1.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Angel's Grace doesn't stop loss of life from effects that say that you lose life.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Casting a spell with split second won't affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can't be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you have less than 1 life, damage dealt to you reduces your life total further below 0 (as normal).","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"In a Commander game, combat damage you're dealt by a commander is still tracked, even if it doesn't change your life total.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Split second doesn't stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can't pay more life than you have, even if you won't lose the game.","oracle_id":"66ca8a60-e028-4a5f-8177-860b888cb9d1","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Test of Endurance’s ability will check your life total as your upkeep begins, before any player has the opportunity to take any actions. If you don’t have 50 or more life at that time, the ability won’t trigger at all. If the ability does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If your life total has fallen below 50 at that point, the ability won’t have any effect.","oracle_id":"ffdad8fb-69ee-40d3-b2eb-b0aee0a5becc","published_at":"2022-12-08","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
